ime.\n\nGala360 has no accounts of its own and no ads or analytics. Purchases are handled by Meta. Privacy policy: https://gala360.aicam.fun/privacy\n\nA new app, rebuilt for Meta Quest. Purchases from the earlier Gear VR / Go app do not carry over.", "short_description": "Gala360 brings back a library of 360-degree panoramas shared by photographers around the world between 2016 and 2022. Browse albums, look around every scene, and follow hotspot tours from place to place. Many albums are free to explore; Gala360 Premium opens the rest, with a 7-day free trial. A new app, rebuilt for Meta Quest. Purchases from the earlier Gear VR / Go app do not carry over."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gala360.aicam.fun/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "STW Software Limited", "support_website_url": "https://gala360.aicam.fun/support", "website_url": "https://gala360.aicam.fun/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "39255688980741835"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1652704319653558"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1652704319653558"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1793136000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1652704319653558"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typ